abstract: >-
  Online battery state and parameter estimation with equivalent-circuit models
  and recursive Gaussian processes. Functional parameters such as the OCV curve
  or the SOC-dependent resistance are reconstructed within the filter directly
  from field operation data, with uncertainty quantification.
